{"id":"torrey:canaanites-the","source":"torrey","name":"Canaanites, The","slug":"canaanites-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Ham — Ge 10:6.","refs":[["Gen",10,6,10,6]]},{"text":"An accursed race — Ge 9:25,26.","refs":[["Gen",9,25,9,25],["Gen",9,26,9,26]]},{"text":"Different families of — Ge 10:15-18.","refs":[["Gen",10,15,10,18]]},{"text":"Comprised seven distinct nations — De 7:1.","refs":[["Deut",7,1,7,1]]},{"text":"Possessions of, how bounded — Ge 10:19.","refs":[["Gen",10,19,10,19]]},{"text":"Country of, fertile — Ex 3:17; Nu 13:27.","refs":[["Exod",3,17,3,17],["Num",13,27,13,27]]},{"text":"Great and mighty. — Nu 13:28; De 7:1.","refs":[["Num",13,28,13,28],["Deut",7,1,7,1]]},{"text":"Idolatrous. — De 29:17.","refs":[["Deut",29,17,29,17]]},{"text":"Superstitious. — De 18:9-11.","refs":[["Deut",18,9,18,11]]},{"text":"Profane and wicked. — Le 18:27.","refs":[["Lev",18,27,18,27]]},{"text":"Extremely numerous — De 7:17.","refs":[["Deut",7,17,7,17]]},{"text":"Had many strong cities — Nu 13:28; De 1:28.","refs":[["Num",13,28,13,28],["Deut",1,28,1,28]]},{"text":"Expelled for wickedness — De 9:4; 18:12.","refs":[["Deut",9,4,9,4],["Deut",18,12,18,12]]},{"text":"Called to dwell amongst. — Ge 12:1-5.","refs":[["Gen",12,1,12,5]]},{"text":"Was promised the country of, of inheritance. — Ge 13:14-17; 15:18; 17:8.","refs":[["Gen",13,14,13,17],["Gen",15,18,15,18],["Gen",17,8,17,8]]},{"text":"Had his faith tried by dwelling amongst. — Ge 12:6; 13:7.","refs":[["Gen",12,6,12,6],["Gen",13,7,13,7]]},{"text":"Kind to the patriarchs — Ge 14:13; 23:6.","refs":[["Gen",14,13,14,13],["Gen",23,6,23,6]]},{"text":"To make no league with. — De 7:2; Jdj 2:2.","refs":[["Deut",7,2,7,2],["Judg",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Not to intermarry with. — De 7:3; Jos 23:12.","refs":[["Deut",7,3,7,3],["Josh",23,12,23,12]]},{"text":"Not to follow idols of. — Ex 23:24; De 7:25.","refs":[["Exod",23,24,23,24],["Deut",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"Not to follow customs of. — Le 18:26,27.","refs":[["Lev",18,26,18,26],["Lev",18,27,18,27]]},{"text":"To destroy, without mercy. — De 7:2,24.","refs":[["Deut",7,2,7,2],["Deut",7,24,7,24]]},{"text":"To destroy all vestiges of their idolatry. — Ex 23:24; De 7:5,25.","refs":[["Exod",23,24,23,24],["Deut",7,5,7,5],["Deut",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"Not to fear. — De 7:17,18; 31:7.","refs":[["Deut",7,17,7,17],["Deut",7,18,7,18],["Deut",31,7,31,7]]},{"text":"Terrified at the approach of Israel — Ex 15:15,16; Jos 2:9-11; 5:1.","refs":[["Exod",15,15,15,15],["Exod",15,16,15,16],["Josh",2,9,2,11],["Josh",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Partially subdued by Israel — Jos 10:1-11:23; Jdj 1:1-36.","refs":[["Josh",10,1,11,23],["Judg",1,1,1,36]]},{"text":"To try Israel. — Jdj 2:21,22; 3:1-4.","refs":[["Judg",2,21,2,21],["Judg",2,22,2,22],["Judg",3,1,3,4]]},{"text":"To chastise Israel. — Nu 33:55; Jdj 2:3; 4:2.","refs":[["Num",33,55,33,55],["Judg",2,3,2,3],["Judg",4,2,4,2]]},{"text":"Israel ensnared by — Jdj 2:3,19; Ps 106:36-38.","refs":[["Judg",2,3,2,3],["Judg",2,19,2,19],["Ps",106,36,106,38]]},{"text":"Some descendants of, in our Lord’s time — Mt 15:22; Mr 7:26.","refs":[["Matt",15,22,15,22],["Mark",7,26,7,26]]}],"refCount":59}
